# ---- CI workflow parked ----
# The project's GitHub token carries only the `repo` scope. GitHub refuses to
# accept a file under .github/workflows/ from such a token (both git push and
# the Contents API), so ci.yml is kept locally and pushed once a token with the
# `workflow` scope is available, or uploaded manually via the GitHub web UI.
# The equivalent protection runs locally: scripts/pre-commit-secret-scan.sh
# (pre-commit) and scripts/pre-push-secret-scan.sh (pre-push).
.github/workflows/ci.yml
